@startuml
'https://plantuml.com/component-diagram

left to right direction
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam nodesep 60
skinparam ranksep 100

' --- Komponenten ---
[experiment]
[OpenClaw]
[LLM]
[MCP Server]
[MailPit]
[Radicale]

' --- Interfaces (jeweils bei ihrer Komponente) ---
"OpenClaw CLI\n(agent --json)" - [OpenClaw]
"OpenAI\nChat\nCompletions" - [LLM]
MCP - [MCP Server]
"Calls/Reset" - [MCP Server]
SMTP - [MailPit]
"REST API" - [MailPit]
CalDAV - [Radicale]

'--- control path ---
[experiment] -> "OpenClaw CLI\n(agent --json)" : docker exec
[OpenClaw] -> MCP : http
[OpenClaw] --> "OpenAI\nChat\nCompletions" : POST /v1/chat/completions
[MCP Server] --> SMTP
CalDAV <-- [MCP Server]

'--- measurement path ---
[experiment] ..> "Calls/Reset" : tool calls incl. failed attempts
[experiment] ..> "REST API" : did the mail arrive?
[experiment] ..> CalDAV : does the event exist?

@enduml